@BookSearchApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5087

### Search books by name (partial, case-insensitive) - 200
GET {{BookSearchApi_HostAddress}}/api/books/search?name=clean
Accept: application/json

### Search with no matches - 404
GET {{BookSearchApi_HostAddress}}/api/books/search?name=zzz
Accept: application/json

### Search with an empty name - 400
GET {{BookSearchApi_HostAddress}}/api/books/search?name=
Accept: application/json

### Get book by ID - 200
GET {{BookSearchApi_HostAddress}}/api/books/1
Accept: application/json

### Get book by an ID that doesn't exist - 404
GET {{BookSearchApi_HostAddress}}/api/books/99
Accept: application/json

###
